1
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:07,248
How long are you

2
00:00:07,249 --> 00:00:08,249
going to do this?

3
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,053
About a week?

4
00:00:11,053 --> 00:00:12,054
What about me then?

5
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:14,068
You said to wait until

6
00:00:14,069 --> 00:00:15,265
the end of the summer exams.

7
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:16,183
While you're waiting

8
00:00:16,183 --> 00:00:18,185
why not wait a bit longer?

9
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:22,688
Okay.

10
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:24,190
We've got plenty of time.

11
00:00:36,245 --> 00:00:37,805
[Basketball Club
Recruiting New Members]

12
00:00:37,913 --> 00:00:38,913
Oh, that thing.

13
00:00:39,665 --> 00:00:40,865
Was it during the orientation?

14
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:43,210
Some guy just handed it to me.

15
00:00:43,752 --> 00:00:44,752
Who?

16
00:00:45,545 --> 00:00:46,718
I couldn't tell because

17
00:00:46,719 --> 00:00:48,006
I wasn't wearing my glasses.

18
00:00:48,757 --> 00:00:50,717
But he was really funny.

19
00:00:51,134 --> 00:00:52,168
He told me to join

20
00:00:52,169 --> 00:00:53,428
without any context.

21
00:00:53,428 --> 00:00:54,638
He promised it would be fun.

22
00:00:56,973 --> 00:00:57,973
What the heck?

23
00:00:58,684 --> 00:00:59,634
Are you smiling while

24
00:00:59,635 --> 00:01:00,769
thinking about another guy?

25
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,520
Huh?

26
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:04,314
I'm really holding

27
00:01:04,315 --> 00:01:05,607
back a lot here.

28
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,402
Isn't this wrong?
